From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 19:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml: add GGML_TYPE_FP8_E4M3 native FP8 weights (type 51)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Block layout mirrors Q8_0 (F16 scale + 32× IEEE float8_e4m3fn). CPU
quant/dequant + vec_dot, CUDA convert/get_rows (dequant GEMM path),
gguf-py roundtrip, and convert_hf_to_gguf --fp8-native for ModelOpt
per-tensor/per-row scales without full F16 expansion.
